sentences.text:
4. Hence, the following:
ORDER (i) The impugned general award dated 02.02.2024 at Annexure-E to the writ petition insofar as the land of the petitioner, which is the subject matter of the instant writ petition, is set aside;
(ii) The respondent/Special Land Acquisition Officer of the KIADB is directed to consider the request of the petitioners for award of compensation by way of an agreement under Section 29(2) of the KIAD Act and pass necessary orders within a period of three months from the date of receipt of copy of this order;

NC: 2024:KHC:37693 (iii) The respondent/Special Land Acquisition Officer, KIADB, is at liberty to withdraw the amount that has been deposited by it pursuant to the general award before the jurisdictional Court;
(iv) It is needless to state that, in the event the petitioners failing to provide necessary documents to establish their ownership over the land concerned or if there is a rival claim, the general award would stand restored;
(v) The writ petition stands disposed of accordingly.

